    {
      "id": "claim_68556eba0f3f4197ae046aa236134fed",
      "statement": "_get_pipeline_configs(node_id) builds a ranked candidate list of 'pipewiresrc path=<node> do-timestamp=true ! ... ! appsink' strings gated by Gst.ElementFactory.find() probes: glupload+glcolorconvert+glcolorscale+gldownload+videoscale, glupload+glcolorconvert+gldownload+videoscale, v4l2convert+videoscale, videoconvert+videoscale, then unscaled gl / v4l2 / videoconvert variants ending in video/x-raw,format=RGB. With scale_factor < 1.0 the early candidates carry scaled caps whose dimensions are rounded down to a multiple of 4 (keeps RGB row strides 4-byte aligned and avoids odd-width caps some converters refuse to link); the appsink uses drop=true max-buffers=1 sync=false so it always serves the freshest frame.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/lumux/capture.py#L393-L466",
